#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"Client Id is not set in the Administer CiviCRM &raquo; System Settings "
"&raquo; Payment Processors."
msgstr "Le Client ID n'est pas renseigné sur cette passerelle de paiement."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"Client Secret Id is not set in the Administer CiviCRM &raquo; System "
"Settings &raquo; Payment Processors."
msgstr ""
"Le Client Secret n'est pas renseigné sur cette passerelle de paiement."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso Organization Name is not set in the Administer CiviCRM &raquo; "
"System Settings &raquo; Payment Processors."
msgstr ""
"Le nom de l'organisation HelloAsso n'est pas renseigné sur cette passerelle "
"de paiement."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso authorization screen is selected for this processor, but no linked"
" HelloAsso organization is stored yet."
msgstr ""
"La mire HelloAsso est sélectionnée pour ce processeur, mais aucune "
"organisation HelloAsso liée n'est encore enregistrée."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Invalid HelloAsso processor configuration for %1:"
msgstr "Configuration du processeur HelloAsso %1 invalide :"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso installment cancellation is available only for processors "
"connected through the authorization screen."
msgstr ""
"L'annulation d'un échéancier HelloAsso est disponible uniquement pour les "
"processeurs connectés via la mire."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The HelloAsso order ID is missing from this recurring contribution."
msgstr ""
"L'identifiant de commande HelloAsso est absent de cette contribution "
"périodique."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso order ID stored on this recurring contribution is invalid."
msgstr ""
"L'identifiant de commande HelloAsso enregistré sur cette contribution "
"périodique est invalide."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso plan was cancelled, but its local CiviCRM records could not be"
" synchronized: %1"
msgstr ""
"Le plan HelloAsso a été annulé, mais ses enregistrements CiviCRM locaux "
"n'ont pas pu être synchronisés : %1"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"Future HelloAsso installments were cancelled successfully. Payments already "
"collected were not refunded."
msgstr ""
"Les échéances futures HelloAsso ont été annulées. Les paiements déjà "
"encaissés n'ont pas été remboursés."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "sandbox"
msgstr "bac à sable"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "production"
msgstr "production"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "%1 (#%2, sandbox linked to live processor #%3)"
msgstr "%1 (#%2, bac à sable lié au processeur actif en production #%3)"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "%1 (#%2, %3)"
msgstr "%1 (#%2, %3)"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
#: Civi/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/CheckoutOption/HelloAssoHostedCheckout.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso payment processor is currently unavailable. Please try again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Le processeur de paiement HelloAsso est temporairement indisponible. "
"Veuillez réessayer ultérieurement."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Unable to reload contribution %1."
msgstr "Impossible de recharger la contribution %1."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid "HelloAsso refunds are disabled by this extension."
msgstr "Les remboursements HelloAsso sont désactivés par cette extension."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso refund cannot be requested without a payment ID and a positive "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Le remboursement HelloAsso ne peut pas être demandé sans identifiant de "
"paiement et montant positif."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso accepted the refund request but did not return a refund operation "
"ID."
msgstr ""
"HelloAsso a accepté la demande de remboursement mais n'a pas retourné "
"d'identifiant d'opération de remboursement."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso refund cannot be requested because the original CiviCRM payment "
"could not be found."
msgstr ""
"Le remboursement HelloAsso ne peut pas être demandé car le paiement CiviCRM "
"d'origine est introuvable."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso only supports full refunds through this integration. Partial "
"refunds must be handled manually in HelloAsso."
msgstr ""
"HelloAsso prend uniquement en charge les remboursements complets dans cette "
"intégration. Les remboursements partiels doivent être traités manuellement "
"dans HelloAsso."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Unable to find the contribution to update for the HelloAsso checkout."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de retrouver la contribution à mettre à jour pour le checkout "
"HelloAsso."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Online contribution"
msgstr "Contribution en ligne"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Unknown error while preparing the HelloAsso redirect."
msgstr "Erreur inconnue lors de la préparation de la redirection HelloAsso."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Unable to update contribution %1."
msgstr "Impossible de mettre à jour la contribution %1."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
#: Civi/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/CheckoutOption/HelloAssoHostedCheckout.php
msgid "HelloAsso installment payments are disabled."
msgstr "Les paiements HelloAsso en plusieurs fois sont désactivés."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Invalid HelloAsso installment schedule: %1"
msgstr "Échéancier HelloAsso invalide : %1"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso error"
msgstr "Erreur HelloAsso"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The %1 must contain at least 3 characters (HelloAsso rule)."
msgstr "Le %1 doit contenir au moins 3 caractères (règle HelloAsso)."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The %1 must not contain 3 repeated characters (HelloAsso rule)."
msgstr "Le %1 ne doit pas contenir 3 caractères répétitifs (règle HelloAsso)."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The %1 must not contain numbers (HelloAsso rule)."
msgstr "Le %1 ne doit pas contenir de chiffres (règle HelloAsso)."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The %1 must contain at least one vowel (HelloAsso rule)."
msgstr "Le %1 doit contenir au moins une voyelle (règle HelloAsso)."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The value of %1 is not allowed by HelloAsso."
msgstr "La valeur du %1 n'est pas autorisée par HelloAsso."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "The %1 contains unauthorized characters (HelloAsso rule)."
msgstr "Le %1 contient des caractères non autorisés (règle HelloAsso)."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "first name"
msgstr "prénom"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "last name"
msgstr "nom"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "First name and last name must not be identical (HelloAsso rule)."
msgstr "Le nom et le prénom ne doivent pas être identiques (règle HelloAsso)."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"No primary email address is available to start the HelloAsso checkout for "
"contribution %1."
msgstr ""
"Aucune adresse email principale n'est disponible pour lancer le checkout "
"HelloAsso de la contribution %1."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Online contribution: %1"
msgstr "Contribution en ligne : %1"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Invalid HelloAsso webhook payload in the queue."
msgstr "Payload webhook HelloAsso invalide dans la file."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "No matching contribution. Webhook ignored."
msgstr "Aucune contribution correspondante. Webhook ignoré."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"Untrusted webhook ignored; no locally expected HelloAsso object identifier."
msgstr ""
"Webhook non approuvé ignoré ; aucun identifiant d'objet HelloAsso localement"
" attendu."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso object not found (404). Short and long follow-up checks have been "
"disabled to avoid repeated calls."
msgstr ""
"Objet HelloAsso introuvable (404). Les révérifications courte et longue ont "
"été désactivées pour éviter des appels répétés."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"A recurring HelloAsso payment is missing its order or installment identity."
msgstr ""
"Un paiement récurrent HelloAsso ne contient pas l'identifiant de sa commande"
" ou de son échéance."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso installment mapping table is missing. Apply the extension "
"database upgrades before processing installments."
msgstr ""
"La table de correspondance des échéances HelloAsso est absente. Appliquez "
"les mises à niveau de la base de données de l'extension avant de traiter les"
" échéances."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"The contribution mapped to this HelloAsso installment no longer exists."
msgstr "La contribution associée à cette échéance HelloAsso n'existe plus."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM could not create the contribution for HelloAsso installment %1."
msgstr ""
"CiviCRM n'a pas pu créer la contribution correspondant à l'échéance "
"HelloAsso %1."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"Contribution %1 is locked by DonRec. The status used for the tax receipt "
"differs from the current HelloAsso payment gateway status (%2). Metadata has"
" been synchronized, but the contribution status has not been changed."
msgstr ""
"La contribution %1 est verrouillée par DonRec. Le statut pris en compte pour"
" le reçu fiscal diffère du statut actuel de la passerelle de paiement "
"HelloAsso (%2). Les métadonnées ont été synchronisées, mais le statut de la "
"contribution n'a pas été modifié."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso notification signature is required but missing."
msgstr "La signature de notification HelloAsso est requise mais manquante."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso notification signature cannot be verified because the local "
"signing key is missing."
msgstr ""
"La signature de la notification HelloAsso ne peut pas être vérifiée car la "
"clé de signature locale est absente."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso notification signature mismatch."
msgstr "Incohérence de la signature de notification HelloAsso."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso partner webhook signature is required but missing."
msgstr ""
"La signature du webhook partenaire HelloAsso est requise mais manquante."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso partner webhook signature cannot be verified because the local "
"signature key is missing."
msgstr ""
"La signature du webhook partenaire HelloAsso ne peut pas être vérifiée car "
"la clé de signature locale est absente."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso partner webhook signature mismatch."
msgstr "Incohérence de la signature du webhook partenaire HelloAsso."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso webhook payment ID could not be confirmed by the API."
msgstr ""
"L'ID de paiement du webhook HelloAsso n'a pas pu être confirmé via l'API."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso webhook checkout intent could not be confirmed with a payment by "
"the API."
msgstr ""
"L'intention de paiement du webhook HelloAsso n'a pas pu être confirmée par "
"un paiement via l'API."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "HelloAsso webhook payload could not be stored in the queue."
msgstr ""
"Le contenu du webhook HelloAsso n'a pas pu être stocké dans la file "
"d'attente."

#: CRM/Core/Payment/HelloAsso.php
msgid "Duplicate webhook ignored."
msgstr "Webhook dupliqué ignoré."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Civirules/Condition/NotFutureInstallment.php
msgid "Contribution is not a future scheduled HelloAsso installment."
msgstr "La contribution n'est pas une échéance future planifiée HelloAsso."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso authentication is currently being refreshed. Please retry the "
"payment."
msgstr ""
"L'authentification HelloAsso est en cours d'actualisation. Veuillez "
"réessayer le paiement."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid "HelloAsso: unable to authenticate with the payment processor API keys."
msgstr ""
"HelloAsso : impossible de s'authentifier avec les clés API du processeur de "
"paiement."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso installment cancellation requires an authorization-screen "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"L'annulation d'un échéancier HelloAsso nécessite une connexion via la mire."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso authorization does not include the RefundManagement privilege "
"required to cancel future installments."
msgstr ""
"L'autorisation HelloAsso ne contient pas le privilège RefundManagement "
"requis pour annuler les échéances futures."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso refused the cancellation. Reconnect the organization through the "
"authorization screen and grant the OrganizationAdmin or FormAdmin role; the "
"client must also include the RefundManagement privilege."
msgstr ""
"HelloAsso a refusé l'annulation. Reconnectez l'association via la mire et "
"accordez le rôle OrganizationAdmin ou FormAdmin ; le client doit également "
"disposer du privilège RefundManagement."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/PartnerAuth.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso payment is temporarily unavailable: the linked organization is not"
" currently allowed by HelloAsso to receive online payments."
msgstr ""
"Le paiement HelloAsso est temporairement indisponible : l'organisation liée "
"n'est actuellement pas autorisée par HelloAsso à recevoir des paiements en "
"ligne."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid "HelloAsso plugin-public mode requires a saved payment processor ID."
msgstr ""
"Le mode plugin-public de HelloAsso requiert un ID de processeur de paiement "
"enregistré."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "HelloAsso API error (%1)"
msgstr "Erreur API HelloAsso (%1)"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid "HelloAsso live API calls require SSL verification to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Les appels à l'API live HelloAsso nécessitent que la vérification SSL soit "
"activée."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/HelloAssoClient.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso processor configuration is incomplete: organization slug is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"La configuration du processeur HelloAsso est incomplète : la slug de "
"l'organisation est manquant."

