msgstr "ID du processeur de paiement : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid ""
"This page is used to enter the shared client, display the link status and "
"start the HelloAsso connection. The general authorization-screen activation "
"switch is configured in the HelloAsso settings."
msgstr ""
"Cette page sert à renseigner le client partagé, afficher l'état de liaison "
"et lancer la connexion HelloAsso. Le switch général d'activation de la mire "
"se règle depuis les paramètres HelloAsso."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Open HelloAsso settings"
msgstr "Ouvrir les paramètres HelloAsso"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Leave blank to keep the current secret."
msgstr "Laisser vide pour conserver le secret actuel."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Authorization URL"
msgstr "URL d'autorisation"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Token URL"
msgstr "URL du token"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid ""
"Community HelloAsso authorization-screen credentials are currently used for "
"this rail. Enter a local client ID and client secret here only if you want "
"to override the community credentials."
msgstr ""
"Les identifiants communautaires de mire HelloAsso sont actuellement utilisés"
" pour ce rail. Renseignez ici un client ID et un client secret locaux "
"seulement si vous voulez remplacer les identifiants communautaires."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid ""
"Local HelloAsso authorization-screen credentials are currently used for this"
" rail."
msgstr ""
"Les identifiants locaux de mire HelloAsso sont actuellement utilisés pour ce"
" rail."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Save authorization-screen settings"
msgstr "Enregistrer les réglages de la mire"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Callback URL to declare at HelloAsso:"
msgstr "URL de callback à déclarer chez HelloAsso :"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Webhook management: %1"
msgstr "Gestion du webhook : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Registered webhook URL: %1"
msgstr "URL webhook enregistrée : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid ""
"The authorization screen is disabled globally. Enable it in HelloAsso "
"settings, then return to this page to connect an organization."
msgstr ""
"La mire est désactivée globalement. Activez-la dans les paramètres HelloAsso"
" puis revenez sur cette page pour connecter une organisation."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Organization linked: %1"
msgstr "Organisation liée : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso authorization link on this rail can no longer be renewed%1%2. "
"Reconnect the organization before accepting new payments through the "
"authorization screen."
msgstr ""
"Le lien d'autorisation HelloAsso sur ce rail ne peut plus être "
"renouvelé%1%2. Reconnectez l'organisation avant d'accepter de nouveaux "
"paiements via l'écran d'autorisation."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso organization linked on this rail is not currently allowed to "
"receive online payments%1%2. Check its administrative status in HelloAsso "
"before accepting new payments through the authorization screen."
msgstr ""
"L'organisation HelloAsso liée sur ce rail n'est actuellement pas autorisée à"
" recevoir des paiements en ligne%1%2. Vérifiez son statut administratif dans"
" HelloAsso avant d'accepter de nouveaux paiements via l'écran "
"d'autorisation."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid ""
"The latest HelloAsso authorization-link renewal failed on this rail. Check "
"the next maintenance job or reconnect the organization if the problem "
"persists."
msgstr ""
"Le dernier renouvellement du lien d'autorisation HelloAsso a échoué sur ce "
"rail. Vérifiez le prochain travail de maintenance ou reconnectez "
"l'organisation si le problème persiste."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Linked on: %1"
msgstr "Liée le : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Access token valid until: %1"
msgstr "Jeton d'accès valable jusqu'au : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
#: helloasso_payment_processor.php
msgid "Authorization link valid until: %1"
msgstr "Liaison d'autorisation valable jusqu'au : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "HelloAsso partner information could not be retrieved: %1"
msgstr ""
"Les informations partenaire HelloAsso n'ont pas pu être récupérées : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Disconnect the linked organization"
msgstr "Déconnecter l'organisation liée"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "No HelloAsso organization is linked yet."
msgstr "Aucune organisation HelloAsso n'est encore liée."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid ""
"The HelloAsso partner settings form token is invalid. Please reload the page"
" and try again."
msgstr ""
"Le jeton du formulaire de paramètres partenaire HelloAsso est invalide. "
"Veuillez recharger la page et réessayer."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "HelloAsso partner API status: reachable."
msgstr "État de l'API partenaire HelloAsso : joignable."

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
msgid "Partner account: %1"
msgstr "Compte partenaire : %1"

#: CRM/HelloassoPaymentProcessor/Page/PartnerAuth.php
