#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Standard frontend bridge (mjwshared)"
msgstr "Pont d'intégration standard (mjwshared)"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Enable the standard HelloAsso frontend integration based on CRM.payment and "
"mjwshared."
msgstr ""
"Active l'intégration frontend standard HelloAsso basée sur CRM.payment et "
"mjwshared."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Secure handling of failure and cancellation URLs"
msgstr "Gestion sécurisée des URL d'échec et d'annulation"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Avoid redirecting users to fragile CiviCRM or AJAX URLs when a payment is "
"cancelled or fails."
msgstr ""
"Évite de renvoyer les utilisateurs vers des URL CiviCRM ou AJAX fragiles "
"lorsqu'un paiement est annulé ou échoue."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Webhook processing queue"
msgstr "File d'attente pour le traitement des webhooks"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Place HelloAsso webhooks in the PaymentprocessorWebhook queue instead of "
"processing them immediately."
msgstr ""
"Place les webhooks HelloAsso dans la file PaymentprocessorWebhook au lieu de"
" les traiter immédiatement."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Payment status reliability for automations (T+5 / T+15 / T+45 min)"
msgstr ""
"Fiabilité du statut de paiement pour les automatisations (T+5 / T+15 / T+45 "
"min)"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Enable automatic checks at T+5, T+15 and T+45 after creation of a HelloAsso "
"checkout. The final check expires an unpaid installment plan or marks a "
"classic checkout as abandoned while keeping its contribution pending for "
"cart reminders. Long-term monitoring of later changes, including refunds, "
"remains independent."
msgstr ""
"Active les contrôles automatiques à T+5, T+15 et T+45 après la création d'un"
" checkout HelloAsso. Le dernier contrôle fait expirer un plan de paiement "
"par échéances impayé ou marque un checkout classique comme abandonné tout en"
" conservant sa contribution en attente pour les relances de panier. Le suivi"
" à long terme des évolutions ultérieures, notamment des remboursements, "
"reste indépendant."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Afform / Form Builder integration"
msgstr "Intégration Afform / Form Builder"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Publish a HelloAsso Checkout Option for Afform / Form Builder based on the "
"CiviCRM core checkout mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Publie une Checkout Option HelloAsso pour Afform / Form Builder en "
"s'appuyant sur le mécanisme de checkout du core CiviCRM."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Enable HelloAsso refunds"
msgstr "Activer les remboursements HelloAsso"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Allow CiviCRM users with refund permissions to request full HelloAsso "
"refunds from the payment refund screen. Refunds require the HelloAsso "
"authorization-screen mode. HelloAsso partial refunds remain unsupported by "
"this integration."
msgstr ""
"Autorise les utilisateurs CiviCRM disposant des droits de remboursement à "
"demander des remboursements complets HelloAsso depuis l'écran de "
"remboursement. Les remboursements nécessitent le mode mire HelloAsso. Les "
"remboursements partiels HelloAsso restent non pris en charge par cette "
"intégration."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Enable HelloAsso installment payments"
msgstr "Activer les paiements HelloAsso en plusieurs fois"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Allow finite monthly installment checkout payloads for HelloAsso payment "
"processors."
msgstr ""
"Autorise les échéanciers mensuels limités pour les processeurs de paiement "
"HelloAsso."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso redirect message on standard forms"
msgstr "Message de redirection HelloAsso sur les formulaires classiques"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Message displayed on standard contribution and event forms when the selected"
" payment processor is HelloAsso."
msgstr ""
"Message affiché sur les formulaires classiques de contribution et "
"d'inscription à un événement lorsque le processeur de paiement sélectionné "
"est HelloAsso."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Enable HelloAsso SEPA direct debit"
msgstr "Activer le prélèvement SEPA HelloAsso"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Offer SEPA direct debit on HelloAsso Checkout, including installment "
"checkouts. HelloAsso only displays it for eligible organizations and may "
"keep card payment available."
msgstr ""
"Propose le prélèvement SEPA sur le Checkout HelloAsso, y compris pour les "
"paiements en plusieurs fois. HelloAsso l'affiche uniquement pour les "
"associations éligibles et peut maintenir le paiement par carte."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Maximum processing batch size (Cron)"
msgstr "Taille maximale des lots de traitement (Cron)"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Maximum number of HelloAsso contributions processed per payment processor "
"during a normal cron execution."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de contributions HelloAsso traitées par processeur pendant "
"une exécution normale du cron."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Strict legacy signature verification"
msgstr "Vérification stricte de la signature historique"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Reject HelloAsso webhooks whose legacy invoiceID/sig signature is missing or"
" invalid."
msgstr ""
"Refuse les webhooks HelloAsso dont la signature legacy invoiceID/sig est "
"absente ou invalide."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Strict partner signature verification"
msgstr "Vérification stricte de la signature partenaire"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Reject HelloAsso partner webhooks whose x-ha-signature header is missing or "
"invalid when a webhook signature key is stored for this processor."
msgstr ""
"Refuse les webhooks partenaire HelloAsso dont le header x-ha-signature est "
"absent ou invalide quand une clé de signature webhook est enregistrée pour "
"ce processeur."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: enable shared connection"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : activer la connexion partagée"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Enable the shared HelloAsso OAuth authorization screen. When this setting is"
" disabled, the authorization-screen interface is no longer offered on "
"HelloAsso processor pages."
msgstr ""
"Active la mire OAuth HelloAsso partagée. Quand ce réglage est désactivé, "
"l'interface mire n'est plus proposée sur les pages processeur HelloAsso."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: production client ID"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : client ID production"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Client ID dedicated to the HelloAsso production authorization screen."
msgstr "Client ID dédié à la mire HelloAsso production."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: sandbox client ID"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : client ID bac à sable"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Client ID dedicated to the HelloAsso sandbox authorization screen."
msgstr "Client ID dédié à la mire HelloAsso bac à sable."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: production client secret"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : client secret production"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"Client secret dedicated to the HelloAsso production authorization screen."
msgstr "Client secret dédié à la mire HelloAsso production."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: sandbox client secret"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : client secret bac à sable"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "Client secret dedicated to the HelloAsso sandbox authorization screen."
msgstr "Client secret dédié à la mire HelloAsso bac à sable."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: authorization URL"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : URL d'autorisation"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso authorization screen URL. In production, the default value is "
"https://auth.helloasso.com/authorize."
msgstr ""
"URL de l'écran d'autorisation HelloAsso. En production, la valeur par défaut"
" est https://auth.helloasso.com/authorize."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen URL for sandbox mode."
msgstr "URL de l'écran d'autorisation HelloAsso pour le mode bac à sable."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid "HelloAsso authorization screen: token URL"
msgstr "Mire HelloAsso : URL du token"

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso endpoint used to exchange the authorization code and refresh OAuth"
" tokens."
msgstr ""
"Endpoint HelloAsso utilisé pour échanger le code d'autorisation et "
"rafraîchir les jetons OAuth."

#: settings/helloasso_payment_processor.setting.php
msgid ""
"HelloAsso endpoint used to exchange the authorization code and refresh OAuth"
" tokens for sandbox mode."
msgstr ""
"Point de terminaison HelloAsso utilisé pour échanger le code d'autorisation "
"et actualiser les jetons OAuth pour le mode bac à sable."
